    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Riney-Scollan 0872988143 are delighted to present this spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home in Rathfarnham, offered in true turn-key condition.\r\nThis much-loved home has been extensively renovated, incorporating an extension and a full downstairs refurbishment in 2019 designed by interior designer Alannah Monks, creating a modern and inviting living space. The property also benefits from triple/double glazed windows and doors. The most recent update, a new high-spec family bathroom completed in 2024, reflects the continued care and attention given to the property over the years.\r\nThe accommodation is bright and well-proportioned throughout, featuring an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area to the rear, ideal for modern family living. Large Attic/store.\r\nPerfectly positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac in an established part of Rathfarnham, the property is within easy reach of excellent schools, local shops, parks, and a reliable, high-frequency bus network providing easy access to the city centre.\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a modernised family home in a highly sought-after location — ready to move in and enjoy.\r\nStylishly renovated three-bedroom semi-detached home in Rathfarnham, presented in turn-key condition and ideally located close to excellent schools, parks, and public transport. The size of 117.6 SqMs excludes the Attic!\r\n________________________________________"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall with guest Shower room and stairs to first floor landing,\r\nFront Sittingroom 5.58m x 3.78m    with floor to ceiling built in Bespoke cabinetry, Large Bay window,\r\nOne of the main features of this fine Family Home is the Alannah Monks designed open plan Livingroom  and Kitchen/Diningroom, The living area 2.89m x 4.67m has  a range of Bespoke cabinetry and the  Kitchen/Dining area 3.90m x 5.74m  has a large range of Kube Eye and Base level units, ample Marble worktop areas and central Island unit, The light in this room is greatly enhanced with the high ceiling. Spacious Utility press which is plumbed for washing machine and spin drier,\r\nFirst floor landing, Hotpress with dual immersion,\r\nBedroom 1) Front Double 3.66m x 3.45m with built in SKON sliderobes,\r\nBedroom 2) Rear Double 3.57m x 3.78\r\nBedroom 3) Front single, 2.73m x 2.38m\r\nFamily Shower room 1.85m x 1.86m which has recently been renovated to a very high standard is fully tiled has an Electric shower WC and WHB,\r\nAttic/Store. 3.57m x 2.89m\r\nMature gardens to front and rear, Side entrance, Shed, Large Deck area, ample off street parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\n•\tFull downstairs renovation (2019) by interior designer Alannah Monks\r\n•\tBrand new family bathroom (2024) finished to a high specification\r\n•\tDownstairs Shower Room which is fully tiled has a WC and WHB\r\n•\tBespoke cabinetry in sitting room and open plan living area\r\n•\tKube kitchen with quality appliances\r\n•\tOpen-plan kitchen/living/dining area\r\n•\tExtension to the rear, fully reinsulated in 2019\r\n•\tHigh-end engineered wooden floors throughout\r\n•\tRecently upgraded gas-fired central heating (GFCH)\r\n•\tAttic/Store\r\n•\tTurn-key condition throughout\r\n•\tWithin catchment area of some of South Dublin’s most highly regarded primary and secondary schools\r\n•\tAdjacent to large green areas and close to major parks \r\n•\tProximity to range of reliable high-frequency bus routes.\r\n•\tQuick and easy access to M50 \r\n•       Double/Triple glazed doors and windows"
      },
